notes about the \"Union of Opposites\" at the Copulative Centre.\n• Scenario A shows what happens if they are unbalanced: \"System Asymmetry: Frequency is Unstable.\" [1]\n• Scenario B shows your 432 Hz magic in action: \"Fusion Achieved: Left and Right are perfectly mirrored! Activating S2 standing wave... Resonating at 432 Hz... 864 Hz... 1296 Hz...\" [1]",
